# FeaturedStory Builder Component

## Overview

A featured article card component registered with Builder Publish. Displays a colored banner header with a badge and title, followed by article metadata (title, description, CTA, read time, category).

## Files

- **Component**: `src/components/builder/FeaturedStory.jsx`
- **Styles**: `src/components/builder/FeaturedStory.scss`
- **Registry**: `src/builder-registry.js`
- **Preview Route**: `/featured-story-preview` → `src/pages/FeaturedStoryPreview.jsx`

## Props / Builder Inputs

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `badge` | string | "FEATURED" | Badge label in banner (leave empty to hide) |
| `bannerTitle` | string | "Featured Story" | Large title shown in the colored banner |
| `bannerColor` | color | "#0F62FE" | Background color of the banner section |
| `title` | string | "Transforming Enterprise..." | Article headline |
| `description` | longText | "Explore how modern..." | Article description/excerpt |
| `ctaText` | string | "Read full story" | CTA button label |
| `ctaUrl` | url | "#" | CTA button href |
| `readTime` | string | "5 min read" | Read time metadata (leave empty to hide) |
| `category` | string | "Design Systems" | Category metadata (leave empty to hide) |

## Styling

- Uses design tokens from `src/styles/tokens/`
- Theme-aware: uses `var(--text-primary)`, `var(--text-secondary)`, `var(--background-primary)`
- Responsive: stacks properly on mobile (min-width breakpoints: 672px)
- CTA button uses Carbon's `<Button kind="danger">` (brand red)
- Meta icons use Carbon `@carbon/icons-react`: `Time` and `Document`

## Design Reference

Based on Figma design: 720×541px card with a blue (#0F62FE) banner, FEATURED badge (pill, #D0E2FF bg / #0043CE text), 48px bold white title, article text body, and footer with CTA + meta items.
